1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:03,579
Do you think I do not know this?

2
00:00:04,469 --> 00:00:05,690
I have tried.

3
00:00:06,239 --> 00:00:08,060
I've tried so hard

4
00:00:08,359 --> 00:00:10,579
to put my past behind me.

5
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,199
But everywhere I turn,

6
00:00:13,859 --> 00:00:15,359
I am reminded

7
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:17,020
of my failure.